[{"i":"2010543955610988546","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参考第二大题的实际操作题，回答下列问题。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 手摇风扇中出现了下列哪2个机械结构？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">轮轴</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">齿轮</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">滑轮</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">斜面</span></p>"}],"a":"A,B","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2010544040763748353","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于手摇风扇采用的传动方式说法正确的是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">能够精准地传递动力</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">传动比可以计算</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">适合远距离传动</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">无法计算传动比</span></p>"}],"a":"A,B","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2010544140781121538","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于手摇把手说法正确的是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相当于连续旋转的杠杆</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相当于滑轮</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相当于齿轮</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相当于轮轴</span></p>"}],"a":"A,D","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2010544240328732673","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于齿轮啮合说法正确的是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">大齿轮带动小齿轮起加速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">小齿轮带动大齿轮起加速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">两个齿轮平行啮合旋转方向相反</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">两个齿轮平行啮合旋转方向相同</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":[]},{"i":"2010549785781624834","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建说明：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请考生制作一个手动风扇模型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建要求：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(a) 具备手动风扇模型大体框架；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(b) 具备二级加速齿轮传动机构；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(c) 具备手摇把手和表示风扇扇叶的部件；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(d) 缓慢旋转手摇把手，风扇能加速旋转；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(e) 整体动作流畅。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">评分项：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 整体框架（40分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 作品零件结构和样例模型基本一致，结构完整；（20分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品相应部件固定可靠；（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(3) 作品整体协调美观。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2. 动力传递/表现形式（30分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 完整实现题目要求的动作；（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3. 完成时间（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">器材说明：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">案例样图:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698885953193975808.jpg\" alt=\"样例1.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698885953193975808.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例2</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698885992247156736.jpg\" alt=\"样例2.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698885992247156736.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例3 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886030708924416.jpg\" alt=\"样例3.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886030708924416.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例4 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886066998026240.jpg\" alt=\"样例4.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886066998026240.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例5</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886102980960256.jpg\" alt=\"样例5.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886102980960256.jpg\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例6</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886125244342272.jpg\" alt=\"样例6.jpg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2026-01-12/8698886125244342272.jpg\" style=\"\"></p>","o":[],"a":"","an":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">评分说明</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 整体框架（40分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 作品零件结构是否和样例模型基本一致、结构完整。具备①模型框架、②手摇把手、③二级加速传动齿轮装置、④风扇扇叶的体现、以上四点缺少一点扣10分，缺少两点及两点以上扣20分。（20分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品相应部件的固定可靠程度；（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(3) 作品的整体协调性和美观性。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2. 动力传递/表现形式（30分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 缓慢摇动手摇把手，风扇扇叶加速旋转；（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3. 完成时间（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在考试时间内完成得10分，超时1分钟扣1分。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">超时10分钟以上不结束操作总成绩记为0分。</span></p>","sc":80.0,"kp":[]}]